{"unit_id":"anbulang__dsh-connect-teleagent#card-zh","repo":"anbulang/dsh-connect-teleagent","commit":"b61e5a07ed8b6f82234e6591de779f3bff68434a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"TeleAgent 模型把本机已登录的模型接入 DSH Web，作为可选模型提供方。它注册 teleagent 路由，通过本机 OpenAI 兼容传输连接上游。用户可选择五种模型，以 chat-pro 或 chat-flash 处理图片，也可使用多轮对话和工具调用；只读积分工具还能查询余额及每日领取状态。适合已有 TeleAgent 桌面端账号、希望在 DSH 使用这些模型的用户。需要本机登录态及上游 TELEAGENT_API_KEY。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:526-610","lib/models.js:26-35","lib/tools.js:92-103","lib/secrets.js:19-26"]}
{"unit_id":"anbulang__dsh-connect-teleagent#card-en","repo":"anbulang/dsh-connect-teleagent","commit":"b61e5a07ed8b6f82234e6591de779f3bff68434a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"TeleAgent Model connects a locally signed-in desktop account to DSH as a selectable provider. It offers five models, image input on chat-pro and chat-flash, multi-turn chats, tool calls, and read-only credit lookup. It requires a local login and upstream TELEAGENT_API_KEY.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:526-610","lib/models.js:26-35","lib/tools.js:92-103","lib/secrets.js:19-26"]}
{"unit_id":"anbulang__dsh-connect-teleagent#feature-1","repo":"anbulang/dsh-connect-teleagent","commit":"b61e5a07ed8b6f82234e6591de779f3bff68434a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"TeleAgent 模型的「模型接入」功能：在 DSH 注册 teleagent 模型提供方，列出五种可选模型。用户在 DSH 选择模型并发送对话后，provider 将请求交给本机传输层。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:526-550","lib/index.js:599-610","lib/models.js:26-32"]}
{"unit_id":"anbulang__dsh-connect-teleagent#feature-2","repo":"anbulang/dsh-connect-teleagent","commit":"b61e5a07ed8b6f82234e6591de779f3bff68434a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"TeleAgent 模型的「图片输入」功能：选择 chat-pro 或 chat-flash 并在 DSH 对话中附加图片，模型请求会按图片输入能力配置发送文本与图片内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/models.js:26-35","lib/index.js:526-550"]}
{"unit_id":"anbulang__dsh-connect-teleagent#feature-3","repo":"anbulang/dsh-connect-teleagent","commit":"b61e5a07ed8b6f82234e6591de779f3bff68434a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"TeleAgent 模型的「积分查询」功能：模型可调用只读工具 teleagent_points，查询本机登录账号的余额、套餐和每日领取状态，并得到整理后的文本结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:15-16","lib/tools.js:92-103"]}
